  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT FOR GENDER JUSTICE 01/12/2025-30/11/2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The New Visions for Achieving Gender Justice: Phase 3 programme in Mpumalanga and Gauteng, South Africa, implemented by Sonke Gender Justice, aims to contribute to reduced gender-based violence and strengthened gender equality. The grant supports community-led accountability, improved knowledge of rights and GBV laws, and increased feminist leadership for women, youth, and gender-diverse persons. Key activities include GBV and legal-literacy training, case monitoring, participation in local governance processes, and strategic litigation and advocacy on gender justice and climate-linked vulnerabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
